> > > Erm... how are you suppoed to get an artifact back in such a case?
>
> > Simple.  Give them another artifact.

Pets are smart about which non-artifacts to wield.  They basically
assume it's uncersed +0 and swap for anything better.  Knowing the
order of priorities they use makes for a smart early weapons
selection strategy.  Pets are NOT smart about which artifacts to
wield.  A pet might currently have Greyswandir but hand it Trollsbane
and it will switch to the newest one it picked up.

> Ah, so the Vorpal Blade does have a use! :-p

With enough pets every artifact can have a use.  Might be fun to
have a pet ogre lord wielding Trollsbane and a pet water troll
wielding Ogresmasher just for style points.  It's probably a bad
idea to give any pet a weapon that has an insta-kill feature, though.
Pets aren't always forever ...



